                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a distillation of the 4X genre into something strange and kind of unique. The visuals might set some people off, but personally I found the bare aesthetic pretty nice. The background and story of the game are both interesting. It is pretty simple once you get down to it and can be a little hard to pierce the diluge of information the game presents you with at the start. Otherwise, well worth your time and money if you enjoy space strategy games.",
